# Advanced roster
ent-MobChildishOni = childish oni
    .desc = An oni from the demonic capital, eager to turn battle into a cruel game.
ent-MobSpiderMercury = Spider of Mercury
    .desc = A pulsing, impossible exoskeleton that seems to observe every weapon raised against it.
ent-MobSpiderMercuryUfo = Spider of Mercury
    .desc = The exoskeleton was only a relay. Its true body descends from above.
ent-MobSpiderMercuryUltimate = the ultimate one
    .desc = Adaptation complete. Every pattern now converges on you.

# Classic trophies
